title: Inter-bloc Relations
subtitle: Build bridges with another bloc.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_relations.svg
view-if: relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.turn_actions += 1; Q.relations_timer = 2; Q.last_card_timer = 'relations'; SW.relationsOpen(Q); !}
new-page: true

= Inter-bloc Relations

No bloc in the Senate can govern alone, and none will govern beside a partner it cannot stand. Which relationship should the Caucus invest in?

- @mod: The Core Moderates.
- @ind: The Independents.
- @rim: The Rimward Coalition.
- @sec: The Security Bloc.
- @guild: The Commerce Guilds.
- @pal: The [+ pal_name +].
- @cis: The Separatist Caucus.
- @rfc: The breakaway party.
- @broker: Broker talks between the [+ bk_a_name +] and the [+ bk_b_name +].
- @summit: Host a summit for the [+ sm_label +].
- @word: A friendly word in the corridors.
- @easy_discard

@mod
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Core Moderates, now [+ mod_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; mod_relation += 15; inst_dissent -= 2

@ind
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Independents, now [+ ind_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; ind_relation += 15

@rim
view-if: parties_has_rim
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Rimward Coalition, now [+ rim_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rim_relation += 15; rimward_dissent -= 2; inst_dissent += 1

@sec
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Security Bloc, now [+ sec_relation : relationships +]. The Pacifists disapprove.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; sec_relation += 15; hawk_dissent -= 2; pacifist_dissent += 3

@guild
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Commerce Guilds, now [+ guild_relation : relationships +]. The Rimward wing disapproves.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; guild_relation += 15; rimward_dissent += 5

@pal
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the [+ pal_name +], now [+ pal_relation : relationships +]. [? if evidence >= 4 : The Caucus is deeply uneasy about this. ?]
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; pal_relation += 15; inst_dissent += 4 if evidence >= 4; pacifist_dissent += 4 if evidence >= 4

@cis
view-if: cis_formed and parties_has_cis
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the Separatist Caucus, now [+ cis_relation : relationships +]. The Hawks will be outraged.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cis_relation += 15; hawk_dissent += 6; pacifist_dissent -= 3

@rfc
view-if: rfc_formed
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 relations with the [+ rfc_name +], now [+ rfc_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rfc_relation += 15

@broker
view-if: bk_ok
subtitle: −1 political capital. +15 to their relations, now [+ bk_rel +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.broker(Q); !}

Caucus envoys shuttle between the two blocs' offices for a week. Old grievances are aired, and some are put to rest. The [+ bk_a_name +] and the [+ bk_b_name +] agree, for now, that they could sit at the same table.

@summit
view-if: sm_ok
subtitle: −2 political capital. +8 to every relationship inside that coalition, our own included.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 2; SW.summit(Q); !}

The Caucus hosts the leaders of the [+ sm_label +] for three days at a retreat on Alderaan. Nobody signs anything. Everybody leaves on speaking terms.

@word
subtitle: Free. +1 relations with the Core Moderates and the Independents.
on-arrival: mod_relation += 1; ind_relation += 1

A few kind words and a shared drink cost nothing, and are worth a little.
